\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Can be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Campsite#Act_Three_Layouts\" title=\"Campsite\">Lower City camp</a> where Isobel usually stands at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1441&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-2592</span>, if Isobel is not talked to for 2 days</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>I know what you did, though I can scarcely believe it. For so long, Allyn and I were apart, then finally reunited. \n</p><p><br>\nBut you ruined it all, and for what? The vanity of yet another power-hungry tyrant.  \n</p><p><br>\nI will find her, and I will free her. Pray you do not see either of us again. \n</p><p><br>\nIsobel.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035127\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2121/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31989/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8764/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 939487/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.086      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   47.086      1 -total\n 63.98%   30.124      9 Template:Icon_text\n 56.84%   26.763     21 Template:Trim\n 36.54%   17.207      1 Template:PageSeo\n 36.40%   17.141      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 28.59%   13.462      3 Template:CharLink\n 27.29%   12.852      4 Template:Icon_link\n 20.59%    9.694      2 Template:Uid\n 19.61%    9.232      9 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- 